# Optional Supabase Cloud Sync Configuration
#
# The 3D House Simulator works 100% offline and locally out of the box using
# browser IndexedDB (for projects/drafts) and localStorage (for preferences).
#
# Set the variables below only if you want to enable optional cloud project
# sync via a Supabase REST endpoint (`projects` table).

# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
